Source common.tape
Output scratch.gif
Set Height 1500
Hide
Type "tmux -L revamped-screens attach -t demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "sensible-revamped help"
Enter
Show
Type "sensible-revamped help"
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "Enter"
Enter
Show
Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot help.png
Sleep 1s
